         "Qty": 20,\
         "% of project": "20.00"\
       \},\
       // more assignments...\
     ];\
     res.status(200).json(sampleAssignments);\
   \};\
   ```\
\
4. **CSV Data Files**: Located in data directories, including:\
   - delivery_planning.csv\
   - resource_allocation.csv\
   - availability_full.csv\
   - genai_creators_workload.csv\
\
## Technical Challenges Discussed\
1. **CSV Data Loading**: Current implementation reads from CSV files\
2. **Deployment Issues**: Challenges with building and deploying on Vercel\
3. **BigQuery Integration**: Plans to replace CSV data source with BigQuery\
\
## Recommendations for BigQuery Integration\
1. **Code Access**: Clone the repository using `git clone https://github.com/MARGAR-AI/client.git`\
\
2. **Data Migration**: \
   - Identify all CSV data files currently in use\
   - Create equivalent tables in BigQuery\
   - Import CSV data into BigQuery tables\
\
3. **Backend Changes**:\
   - Install Google Cloud BigQuery library: `npm install @google-cloud/bigquery`\
   - Set up authentication and environment variables\
   - Replace CSV loading code with BigQuery queries\
   - Maintain the same data structure in API responses\
\
4. **Testing Strategy**:\
   - Test each API endpoint individually\
   - Validate\
